	(text "Blend IN+, V_ISO, and GND_ISO into one voltage, CONT.\nTracks your input but stays in the 555's working window: \n0-10 V in becomes about 1-4 V out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 52.832 119.634 0)
		(effects
